chuckcar, you evidently don't know anything about what ttyrec is or
what it is for. Please read up on it.

http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ttyrec
http://angband.pl/termrec.html

am, ttyrec recordings from NAO are made slightly differently than those
made from Windows games using termrec. ttyrec captures individual
characters sent to the tty -- in NAO's case, sent through the telnet
conversations -- whereas termrec on Windows does periodic screen grabs
and looks for differences. Making sure nothing else is eating your CPU
while playing can help.



